{# Thread root for a watched issue: the full card. Created ONCE per (issue, room)
   — eagerly when the issue opens, or lazily on the first later event (comment /
   watched-label add). Always the same shape. Everything else about the issue
   (close/reopen, comments, assignee/due changes) nests under this message. #}
🚩 <b>Задача</b> · <a href="{{ url | safe_url }}">#{{ iid }}</a> <b>{{ title | truncate(120, true, '…', 0) }}</b>
{% if description %}<blockquote>{{ clip_comment(description, url) }}</blockquote>{% endif %}
{% set shown = display_labels(labels) %}{% if due %}<br>📅 {{ due | ru_date }}{% endif %}{% if assignees %}{% if due %} · {% else %}<br>{% endif %}👤 {{ mentions(assignees) }}{% endif %}{% if shown %}<br>{{ labels_html(shown) }}{% endif %}
